# Downloaded forensic/archive bundles. `polymarket_data/archive.zip` is 42.5 GB, was untracked,
# and matched no existing rule - so `git add -A` walked it on every commit (hanging for minutes)
# and one careless add would have staged it. The data itself is left alone; only git is told to
# ignore it.
polymarket_data/
*.zip
